Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
Source: https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/open-knowledge-format

The following files are derived works, modified from the upstream sources
noted against each. Every modification is listed in the file's own header.

  okf.py             <- src/reference_agent/bundle/document.py
                        src/reference_agent/viewer/generator.py
  templates/viz.html <- src/reference_agent/viewer/templates/viz.html
  static/viz.css     <- src/reference_agent/viewer/static/viz.css
  static/viz.js      <- src/reference_agent/viewer/static/viz.js

Summary of changes:
  * The Python package was collapsed into one module, okf.py.
  * A `validate` subcommand was added; upstream ships no conformance checker.
  * Link extraction resolves bundle-absolute (`/`-prefixed) links and ignores
    links inside code spans and fences.
  * `log.md` is excluded from the concept walk.
  * Timestamp parsing accepts a trailing `Z` on Python 3.10.
  * Node colors are derived from a hash of the concept `type`.
  * Search and the type filter share one filter pass, and a type legend was
    added.
  * The viewer's JavaScript dependencies are inlined rather than loaded from a
    CDN.
  * Regenerating over an existing viz.html reuses its embedded bundle name
    when no name is given.


